--- !u!114 &1153711067
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1153711064}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 72dcd122254073845a271b4898476ffc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MuseumTerminalDisplay
  pages:
  - title: I. THE WRITTEN WORD
    eraCode: PTOLEMAIC DYNASTY // 196 B.C.
    bodyText: 'In Memphis, Egypt, priests carved a royal decree across three scripts:

      Hieroglyphs for the gods, Demotic for the people, and Greek for the crown.

      Two millennia later, Terrans used this linguistic triad to unlock lost millennia of voices.'
  - title: II. THE ARCTIC SANCTUARY
    eraCode: SPITSBERGEN ARCHIPELAGO // 2008 A.D.
    bodyText: 'Chiseled 120 meters deep into permafrost sandstone on Svalbard Island,

      humanity buried over 1.3 million distinct crop seed accessions.

      A planetary backup vault designed to outlive civilizational collapse, floods, and wars.'
  - title: III. THE MOLECULAR SCRIPT
    eraCode: THE HUMAN GENOME // 2003 A.D.
    bodyText: "Using chemical sequencing and digital supercomputing, humanity decoded\nits own 3.2 billion base-pair blueprint. The species crossed a threshold:\nlife on Earth was no longer just read by natural selection\u2014it could read itself."
  - title: DIVE PROTOCOL // WORLD 3
    eraCode: SENSORY 6DoF IMMERSION READY
    bodyText: 'Full VR world transition available: The Heart of Humanity.


      Reach out and cradle the Living Terran Sphere, or press the DIVE PEDESTAL to pull the biological and cultural archive into your consciousness and enter the Arctic Seed & Language Sanctuary.'
  currentPageIndex: 0
  titleTextMesh: {fileID: 1301657015}
  bodyTextMesh: {fileID: 1740536059}
  footerTextMesh: {fileID: 925418342}
  terminalScreenLight: {fileID: 262201090}
  audioSource: {fileID: 1153711066}
  switchPageClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f9a879c27c464e6439a51ed5d6159d7a, type: 3}
